  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Qmunity/BluePower/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"logo.png\" width=\"464\" height=\"117\"></p><p>Blue Power 是一款科技模组，为游戏新增了多种操纵与传输方块及红石信号的方式。</p><p>初始版本将持续扩展，核心机制将大幅改动，带来全新的体验与进程。本模组处于持续开发阶段，功能可能随时增减。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>欢迎直接将其加入您的模组包，无需询问。祝您游玩愉快！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>机器与工作台：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/308599046044647435/368948734685478923/unknown.png\" alt=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/308599046044647435/368948734685478923/unknown.png\" width=\"425\" height=\"239\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>火山：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/C1PqOE3UUAAKtx1?format=jpg&amp;name=900x900\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"425\" height=\"239\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>&nbsp;灯具：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/547807587379183647/547807796679147520/unknown.png?width=1277&amp;height=684\" alt=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/547807587379183647/547807796679147520/unknown.png?width=1277&amp;height=684\" width=\"424\" height=\"227\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>蓝能电力：</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/547807587379183647/624672118818209792/unknown.png\" alt=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/547807587379183647/624672118818209792/unknown.png\" width=\"423\" height=\"238\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>移植进度：</strong></span><br>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>目前已包含：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>工作台</li>\n<li>灯具</li>\n<li>世界生成</li>\n<li>作物</li>\n<li>工具</li>\n<li>合金炉</li>\n<li>世界操纵机器</li>\n<li>蓝能电力</li>\n<li>微缩方块</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>开发中：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>导线</li>\n<li>逻辑门</li>\n<li>管道</li>\n<li>电脑</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>重要资讯：</strong></span></h2><p>1.12 / 1.14 版本不再需要 Forge Multipart 或 QmunityLib。</p><p>建议为 1.12 版本安装 ConnectedTextureMod 以实现部分方块的连接纹理与光照效果。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>1.7.10 版本仍需 QmunityLib！&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">下载地址：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/qmunitylib\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/qmunitylib</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>错误回报：</strong></span></h2><p>请于问题追踪器回报错误，勿在此处提交。<br><a href=\"https://github.com/Qmunity/BluePower/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Qmunity/BluePower/issues</a></p>",
